    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pepco home energy check-ups can help you make easy changes to save energy and money. You can now receive either a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "virtual",
            "ref": "v-virtual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " check-up or a traditional, in-person check-up. Both types of check-ups are provided at no additional cost to your existing Pepco electrical services."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Virtual home energy check-up"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Book an appointment to meet with a Pepco Energy Expert via phone. During your virtual check-up, you will:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Answer questions about your home;"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Look at specific items that use energy, like home appliances and lighting;"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Discover small changes you can make in your home to be more energy-efficient."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After your appointment, you can apply for a no-cost Pepco Box. It includes two ENERGY STAR LED bulbs and some other energy-saving products. The Box will be mailed to you so you can start saving energy without leaving home."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In-person quick home energy check-up"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Book an appointment to meet with a Pepco Energy Expert at your home. In about an hour, the Energy Expert will:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l2",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Check energy efficiency problems with your heating and cooling systems, windows, doors, and more;"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Provide a report that lists suggested energy efficiency "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "upgrades",
              "ref": "v-upgrade"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ";"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Install energy-saving products like ENERGY STAR LED bulbs at no cost."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The ENERGY STAR difference"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During your home energy check-up, an Energy Expert may install products including ENERGY STAR LED bulbs. Compared with an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "incandescent bulb",
            "zh": "白炽灯泡"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", an ENERGY STAR LED bulb lasts 15 times longer and uses about 80% less energy. Over its lifetime, it saves about $55 in electricity costs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Almost half of the average American household’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "annual",
            "ref": "v-annual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " energy bill goes to heating and cooling. That’s more than $900 a year! So you may also consider installing an ENERGY STAR air conditioner. Automatically "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "adjusting",
            "ref": "v-adjust"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your home’s temperature can save you lots of money!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pepco Electric"
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "24/7 Customer Service: 202-833-7500"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
